[316.318122, "o", "\u001b7\u001b[2;23r\u001b8\u001b[23d\n\u001b[1;30r\u001b[21;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[32m**Assumptions:**\r\u001b[22d\u001b[35m  * \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mBranch agents will have occasional network connectivity to sync queued transaction batches.\r\u001b[23d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m  * \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mFree-tier runners (GitHub Actions) and local toolchains provide complete validation parity.\r\u001b[24d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[32m**Constraints:**\r\u001b[25d\u001b[35m  * \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mInfrastructure operational budget is R0.00 (Zero Standing Cost).\r\u001b[26d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m  * \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mRepositories remain public, requiring absolute prevention of hardcoded secrets or real PII.\r\u001b[27d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m  * \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mRoles must rotate between Build Lead and Assurance Lead at each phase boundary.\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
