[392.129856, "o", "\u001b[4T\u001b[1;30r\u001b[9;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[32m**Objective 1 (Zero-Cost Code-Defined Architecture):**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Model and deploy an AWS-pattern cloud backend using OpenTofu a\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[10;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[32m**Objective 2 (Endpoint & Edge Security):**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Define declarative device configuration and encryption baselines for remo\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[11;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[32m**Objective 3 (Automated Pipeline Gates):**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Implement GitHub Actions workflows that automatically detect and block un\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[12;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[32m**Objective 4 (Measured Disaster Recovery):**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Prove measured Recovery Time Objectives (RTO) and Recovery Point Object\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[13;1H"]
[392.129894, "o", "<\u001b(B\u001b[my decision ties directly to a POPIA requirement and business risk.\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
